// Title: Potential Perl Reverse Shell Execution
// Rule ID: 259df6bc-003f-4306-9f54-4ff1a08fa38e
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
